    "The top 5 root causes account for 38.3% of all incidents; the largest is 'Connection pool exhaustion' (8.6%).",
    "34.0% of incidents repeat the same service and root cause within 7 days of the previous one.",
    "6 noisy alert rules (75%+ auto-resolved) produce 60.7% of all alert volume.",
    "Incidents peak on Tue and Thu, and at 15:00.",
    "Orion Logistics lost the most time to incidents (1286.1 downtime hours across 735 incidents)."
